<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>

<!--
	The event-management demo data, so the application shows a living business on its first start:
	three venues with their rooms, four events in four different states, their programme, the
	people who speak and register, two sponsors and the invoices on both sides of the budget.

	The dates are chosen around the autumn of 2026 so that one event is over, one is open for
	registration, one is planned and one is a draft - and so that one incoming invoice is overdue,
	which is the question the overdue column and the chat are there to answer.

	Load-once: InitialDataSetupService records the file name, so editing this file changes nothing
	in a database that already read it (rename it to re-import).
-->
